		{"id":"lang-python","type":"text","text":"## Python\n`import`, `from … import`, relative imports, a `.pyi` stub\n\nShift+click: [[python]]","x":640,"y":0,"width":280,"height":150,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"lang-go","type":"text","text":"## Go\n`import` paths resolved via go.mod\n\nShift+click: [[go]]","x":960,"y":0,"width":280,"height":150,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"lang-lisp","type":"text","text":"## Common Lisp\n`require`, `defpackage :use` (.lisp/.lsp/.cl)\n\nShift+click: [[lisp]]","x":0,"y":190,"width":280,"height":150,"color":"6"},
