		{"id":"lang-vbnet","type":"text","text":"## VB.NET\n`Imports`, `Inherits`, `Implements` (see README: 0 edges today)\n\nShift+click: [[vbnet]]","x":640,"y":190,"width":280,"height":150,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"lang-javascript","type":"text","text":"## JavaScript / JSX\n`require`, `import()`, .mjs/.cjs/.jsx\n\nShift+click: [[javascript]]","x":960,"y":190,"width":280,"height":150,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"lang-typescript","type":"text","text":"## TypeScript / TSX\nrelative, `.js`→`.ts`, tsconfig `baseUrl`/`paths`/`extends`, .mts/.cts, JSON import\n\nShift+click: [[typescript]]","x":0,"y":380,"width":280,"height":150,"color":"5"},
