		{"id":"lang-bash","type":"text","text":"## Shell\n`source`, `.`, `./x.sh`, `bash x.sh`, `$(dirname \"$0\")`\n\nShift+click: [[bash]]","x":0,"y":570,"width":280,"height":150,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"intro","type":"text","text":"# Codestellation test data\nEvery supported file type, as small projects.\n\n- **Shift+click** a language box to open its code in 3D; Esc comes back\n- Shift+click **Canvas features** to go into a nested canvas\n- **Cmd+F** searches every canvas\n\nExpected results: `test_data/README.md`","x":-40,"y":-380,"width":460,"height":260},
		{"id":"nested","type":"text","text":"## Canvas features\nA nested canvas with a weak link back to the TypeScript box.\n\n[[canvas-features.canvas]]","x":480,"y":-380,"width":320,"height":170,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"lang-powershell","type":"text","text":"## PowerShell\ndot-sourcing, `Import-Module`, `using module`, `.psd1` manifests, runs a `.bat`\n\nShift+click: [[powershell]]","x":320,"y":570,"width":280,"height":150,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"lang-batch","type":"text","text":"## Batch / CMD\n`call`, `%~dp0`, direct runs, `start`, `powershell -File` a `.ps1`\n\nShift+click: [[batch]]","x":640,"y":570,"width":280,"height":150,"color":"1"}
